      "message": "struct pdc_data_t is hidden in pdc_rts54xx.c. Do you suggest we change pdc_cci_cb_t to include a connector number (instead of struct device)? Alternatively, we can use the connector change indicator in cci_event to pass the connector number but that\u0027s against the spec.",
