      "writtenOn": "2024-05-29T20:54:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My immediate concern is the logging doesn\u0027t identify which port had the command completion event.\n\nBut as I look at this closer, `ucsi_ppm_execute_cmd_sync()` sends a command on a specific LPM, but you only track one `k_event` for the PPM driver (which supports multiple LPMs).\n\nCan multiple calls to `ucsi_ppm_execute_cmd_sync()`, targeting different LPMs, run concurrently?  If, so you need some locking or you need to track events on each LPM separately.",
